@startuml IGshorts_Capabilities_And_Dependencies
title IGshorts — Capability Map\nWhat we need externally → What is hard → What we deliver

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1F2937
skinparam roundCorner 16
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1E293B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBorderThickness 2
skinparam packageFontColor #0F172A
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam packageFontSize 14
skinparam rectangleBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam rectangleFontColor #1E293B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706
skinparam noteFontColor #78350F
skinparam noteFontSize 11
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam Padding 8
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50

top to bottom direction

'════════════════════════════════════════
' C — EXTERNAL (top = inputs first)
'════════════════════════════════════════
package "C  ·  WHAT WE REQUIRE EXTERNALLY\n(must come from outside our code)" as Ext #DBEAFE {

  together {
    rectangle "**1. Meta / Instagram**\n----\n• Graph API access\n• App Review approval\n• Rate-limit headroom" as Meta #BFDBFE

    rectangle "**2. Content / Editorial**\n----\n• Watchlist 500–2000 creators\n• News · tickers · corrections\n• Niche + state / metro tags" as Editorial #93C5FD

    rectangle "**3. Business / Ops**\n----\n• Domain (IGshorts.com)\n• Score rules sign-off\n• Privacy · ToS · brand" as Biz #60A5FA

    rectangle "**4. Optional (later)**\n----\n• Creators claim profiles\n• Real Insights path\n• Licensed data vendor" as Later #3B82F6
  }
}

'════════════════════════════════════════
' B — CONSTRAINTS (middle)
'════════════════════════════════════════
package "B  ·  WHAT IS HARD / LIMITED\n(doable only with constraints)" as Hard #FFEDD5 {

  together {
    rectangle "**True IG impressions**\n----\nOnly for accounts we manage\nor creators who claim later\n→ MVP uses proxy score" as Impressions #FDE68A

    rectangle "**Auto Top-by-state**\n----\nNo official IG geo chart\n→ We tag regions ourselves\n(editorial + watchlist)" as Geo #FCD34D

    rectangle "**Full IG firehose**\n----\nCannot scrape all trends\n→ Watchlist + editorial\ninstead of open firehose" as Firehose #FBBF24
  }
}

'════════════════════════════════════════
' A — DELIVERABLES (bottom = outcome)
'════════════════════════════════════════
package "A  ·  WHAT WE CAN BUILD & DELIVER\n(fully in our control)" as Ours #DCFCE7 {

  rectangle "**Platform foundation**\nAWS · API · DB · Redis · Admin" as Platform #86EFAC

  together {
    rectangle "**Rankings engine**\nIGshorts Score · history · ↑↓\nIndia / region / category charts" as Rank #4ADE80

    rectangle "**Product surfaces**\nNews · hashtag tickers\nRegion explorer · methodology" as Surfaces #22C55E

    rectangle "**Public charts website**\nBillboard + CMC style UI\nTop-10 · movers · filters" as Site #16A34A
  }
}

' Force clean vertical story — few arrows only
Ext -down-> Hard : **shape the approach**\n(limits + workarounds)
Hard -down-> Ours : **define the MVP**\n(proxy score · watchlist · tags)
Ext -down-> Ours : **feed the product**\n(API metrics · content · domain)

' Keep internal A layout tidy without spaghetti
Platform -down-> Rank
Platform -down-> Surfaces
Platform -down-> Site

' Hidden links keep cards aligned in a row
Meta -[hidden]right-> Editorial
Editorial -[hidden]right-> Biz
Biz -[hidden]right-> Later
Impressions -[hidden]right-> Geo
Geo -[hidden]right-> Firehose
Rank -[hidden]right-> Surfaces
Surfaces -[hidden]right-> Site

note as N1
  **How the pieces connect (read this instead of many arrows)**
  |= From (C / B) |= Into (A) |= What it enables |
  | Meta API | Rankings + Website | Profile / hashtag metrics + official embeds |
  | Editorial team | Rankings + Surfaces | Watchlist, boosts, news, tickers, region tags |
  | Business / Ops | Website | Domain, legal, scoring policy |
  | Optional later | True impressions | Real Insights when creators claim |
  | Hard limits | Rankings MVP | Proxy **IGshorts Score** (not raw impressions) |
end note

N1 .. Ours

note as N2
  **Team takeaway**
  We own product, UI, scoring & cloud.
  Without Meta + editorial + ops sign-off,
  charts look empty, stale, or non-compliant.
end note

N2 .. Ext

legend right
  |= Zone |= Meaning |= Colour |
  | **C** | External requirement | <#DBEAFE> Blue |
  | **B** | Hard / constrained | <#FFEDD5> Amber |
  | **A** | We can deliver | <#DCFCE7> Green |
endlegend

@enduml
